/F2 16 Tf (Ridgeline 2P and 3P Tent: Owner's manual) Tj T* T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Thank you for choosing a Ridgeline tent. Keep this manual with your tent.) Tj T*
T* /F2 12 Tf (In the box) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Inner tent, rainfly, DAC aluminium pole set, 10 stakes, 4 guylines, repair kit and stuff sack.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (The footprint is sold separately \(FP-R2 for the 2P, FP-R3 for the 3P\).) Tj T*
T* /F2 12 Tf (Pitching) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (1. Lay out the footprint, shiny side up, and the inner tent on top, doors where you want them.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (2. Stake the four corners of the inner tent through the footprint's corner webbing.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (3. Assemble the poles and seat the ends in the corner grommets, colour to colour.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (4. Clip the inner tent to the poles, starting from the bottom.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (5. Drape the rainfly over the poles with its doors over the inner doors, and buckle it at the corners.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (6. Stake out the vestibules and tension the guylines. In wind, face the narrow end into the wind.) Tj T*
T* /F2 12 Tf (Taking it down) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Unclip in reverse order. Fold the poles from the middle so the shock cord wears evenly.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
