T* /F2 12 Tf (Care and storage) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Never store the tent wet. Dry it within 24 hours, or mildew will stain and weaken the fabric.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Clean with lukewarm water and a sponge. Do not use detergent or a washing machine.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Store loosely in a dry place, out of the sun, not compressed in the stuff sack.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (The seams are factory taped. Re-seal them with seam sealer after about three seasons of use.) Tj T*
T* /F2 12 Tf (Condensation) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (On cold, still nights, water can condense on the inside of the rainfly. This is not a leak.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Open both rainfly vents and keep the doors partly open to let moist air out.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
