T* /F2 12 Tf (Troubleshooting and repairs) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Small tear in the rainfly or inner \(under 3 cm\): clean and dry the area, then apply a patch) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (from the repair kit to both sides. Larger tears, and any tear along a seam, need a) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (replacement rainfly: RF-R2 for the 2P, RF-R3 for the 3P.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Bent or cracked pole section: slide the splint sleeve from the repair kit over the damaged) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (section and tape both ends. This is a temporary fix; replace the pole set \(PK-R\).) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Stuck zipper: do not force it. Rinse grit out with water and pull the slider back gently.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (A zipper that splits behind the slider is covered by the warranty.) Tj T*
T* /F2 12 Tf (Warranty) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Your tent has a two-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship.) Tj T*
/F1 10.5 Tf (Contact Acme support with your order number.) Tj T*
ET
